3. Assigned the Policy

The policy was assigned to: All devices
Assignment status: Active.
No device groups were excluded.

This demonstrated the difference between:

Assignment

Determines which devices are targeted by a policy.

Policy Application

Determines whether the targeted device has actually received and successfully applied the policy.

An active assignment does not automatically mean that the policy has already been applied.

